WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.780
You can now use Claude Code to edit your entire Shopify store.

00:00:03.781 --> 00:00:06.061
You just ask it what you want and a few minutes later,

00:00:06.062 --> 00:00:08.941
it updates your store exactly the way you asked.

00:00:08.942 --> 00:00:10.141
You don't need any coding knowledge.

00:00:10.142 --> 00:00:11.581
You don't need to add any apps.

00:00:11.582 --> 00:00:13.381
You don't even need a developer.

00:00:13.382 --> 00:00:15.081
You just need a single prompt.

00:00:15.240 --> 00:00:17.100
Let me show what I mean. But have a look at this store here.

00:00:17.101 --> 00:00:19.141
This is built on the standard horizon theme.

00:00:19.142 --> 00:00:20.741
It's a standard horizon template.

00:00:20.742 --> 00:00:21.981
And if you look down, it looks okay,

00:00:21.982 --> 00:00:23.701
but it looks like every other store.

00:00:23.702 --> 00:00:26.161
This is one that I edited with Claude code.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.460
Now it looks night and day.

00:00:27.461 --> 00:00:29.621
It looks so much better. It's gonna convert a lot better.

00:00:29.622 --> 00:00:31.381
It has so much more detail

00:00:31.382 --> 00:00:33.741
and it only took me about 30 minutes to build.

00:00:33.742 --> 00:00:36.501
Honestly, in the last 15 years of scaling e commerce stores,

00:00:36.502 --> 00:00:38.461
I've never seen anything like this.

00:00:38.462 --> 00:00:41.801
For the first time ever, non technical founders

00:00:42.020 --> 00:00:44.420
are going to have complete control over their store.

00:00:44.421 --> 00:00:45.221
In this tutorial,

00:00:45.222 --> 00:00:48.221
I'm going to show you how to set up a Claude code for Shopify

00:00:48.222 --> 00:00:51.681
from start to finish. So grab yourself a coffee and let's get started.
